--- !u!114 &1870295258
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1870295256}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3811d5299b48e3e43a4c2383fffe0b8c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1136095212}
  characterNameText: {fileID: 864568499}
  dialogueAudioSource: {fileID: 383833964}
  characterPortrait: {fileID: 45363629}
  shikiSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f671973af56c57c48abb287dddea2ac7, type: 3}
  makiSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 012169a26b7a0b74790b71a218e9272f, type: 3}
  dialogueSnippets:
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "(Wow, the stage is different when you\u2019re standing
      on it.)"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dba5d00ac7a2c824c98481b8084916c7, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "(I\u2019ve been to a bunch of idol concerts, sure.
      It\u2019s not like there\u2019s much else to do in this place, and there have
      been even more than usual recently.)"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3a194f0aa8765134e9715a76cdc3b1bf, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 9.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "(You can\u2019t get away from it.)"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 58db69b51831a864b9ead0da63d09e86, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "(But I\u2019ve never been actually on the stage. Security
      just waved me right through.)"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 48c566df96e69c94196c67cb4d9ea6a8, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "(It looks so weird with no one here. The tech is incredible
      though, I can\u2019t deny that. I wonder how\u2026)"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 08250e736b4cd7c439f2f6827a0885e0, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 8.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: (Blimey Maki, no time to even catch my breath! Better
      answer.)
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6fa10a7187d2576469079dd0da13e423, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Are you psychic? I just got here
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 60bf584450dd15d469d9a5d016f0e207, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I\u2019ve done the walk from our place to the stage
      five to six times a week since I was 12, I know how long it takes. I added
      three minutes as you know it less well. Minus one as you were in a hurry. "
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ca9ef33b34cb49242bdb19c1d7a5dee2, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 11.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "\u2026Fair."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a8f4f6219adb9794b9dec93148c52d2b, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: You ready?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 162619544efb0e24eae1e7964708bec4, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I kinda have to be, don\u2019t I? "
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4e72da866b4a2b04daddf6b3e709694e, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: " Yes! Let\u2019s get started"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 843bd254113d6c143ba5e4665ca4d4fc, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: 'OK, Shiki! So, as you know, idol concerts on our ship
      are a sound and light extravaganza!! '
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 569a76c415b1f2040acdf81aa04a7357, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 8.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Fortunately for you, the flying lights aren\u2019t
      just fun for the audience to look at, they tell you when to move!"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8c0c1a2b924267e41afecb3468d6e444, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 6.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: OK... But which lights and which moves??
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d1ef8969135ff914d91f44563922a182, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I\u2019ll break it down. Let\u2019s do your left hand
      first."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1ad89c5472127ba42bd7d0bd88c95414, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Left is pink right?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c05bfa4f5db213645acfbea68a278af0, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.3
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Left is pink. You read the handbook at least.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 46035c9ba4d48904a8975f7115bbd609, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: 'OK Shiki, I want you to point at the pink triangles
      to the beat. | '
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 33151a2feb89ead48821f6b0a7a0cf14, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Just point?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 165f59b23f66828468429aa8515f5261, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Just point.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6ecb4b5f3c5b06e4092266e1bdec5b6d, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: 'If you really <i> feel </i> the rhythm it will be a
      vibe, trust me. '
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c48c7c3c57356ad4f9d79a7dae166776, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: 'OK, for those of us with slightly <i> less </i> rhythm
      in our bodies, when do you point? '
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a5a7fd06c9213ae4ba7a3c80faeb000c, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 7.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: When the triangle and its spinning outline overlap.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 40aa9abde6eb90b4eb1b35411e9c1772, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Which is also the moment they reach the screen.  Which
      is also on beat.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b7a404af0ef26944c9eb46962746b893, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: " It\u2019s really not that hard"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2c80ebd92e663bc44bbb72bc0cef1f87, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Easy for you to say\u2026"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e7bcc901e2abbc040b0c0e82e12ebfdf, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: What was that?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2bd0c6d10de0bda498047a944634e961, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Nothing, let\u2019s try it."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: de2f2c5958da01645b29c97d7e5a1f02, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Finally! OK, I\u2019ll turn on some music."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: df8be05b77e840048bb52bc29f3def1e, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Point at the triangles with your left hand, Shiki! Let's
      go!
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a2f6e7e91684d1c4d8c602cd94c04455, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "OK, that wasn\u2019t that bad!"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1aaf7125d92bbdd47bf60f1701b2e2cb, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "It\u2019s fun right? OK let\u2019s add the right hand."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9b063b396a5ae974b8a930531c0576ee, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: 'Already? '
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8e1b70c224e514a4d8ae2ec0acb8eb67, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: " Well I trained for five years, you have five hours
      until you debut, so\u2026 "
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c1ef59dc618508941866e5c0143bd604, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 6.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Point taken.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f3d80652f26d68e4681eaa3b21e6282d, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "It\u2019s just the same thing. "
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 24cb53ba16908c84fbd4ef2ac5dc125e, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Pink for left, blue for right. Hit the triangles to
      the beat\u2014"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2d908307834f44141a216bab165d15f0, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: At the moment they overlap, which is also the moment
      they reach the blue frame on my screen.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 61304e1dc9f495241bd5c51707808b57, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: ' A pro!'
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 06cb9e2b9d44d5347a44e1b178d12138, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I wish. Let\u2019s just give it a go"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 19696df4b137a414fa0d0a5f1e7b3cec, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: " I think I\u2019m getting the hang of it! "
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9dc7dafb61afb3149a81101a06a1915d, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "You\u2019re doing great! But it\u2019s about to get
      a bit more complicated."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 44e395cf3d4bb7444936a1525078ec50, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Both hands?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 40f87db9c477a3f4c9ae680047b15833, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Both hands.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ffeecfc78e6761b4d95b801a1693483b, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: " When we point at the same time, it\u2019s for the
      idol\u2019s symbol. Mine is\u2026"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb22ebc3d8acab3499b21d62791bcc2e, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: A panda.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 04036c47a72aa094092d2165940be717, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "\u2026 "
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Maki\u2026"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 388326394b621ee41b690320d0063129, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Of course, seeing as the switch was a last minute thing,
      we don\u2019t have a symbol for you."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a40c4f192e72ffa46a15554a6416db63, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "So for now, you\u2019re going to be a panda too."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3104da297a6e9b248bce9b1c44d11747, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Sis, are you sure you\u2019re OK with this?"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0999b30d09e7e3f4a95aa4908f6d698c, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Well\u2026 It was you who gave me that panda so\u2026"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ea07370b764c6ae4aaef6aa316a52812, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "\u2026"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Anyway, this isn\u2019t a big step up. "
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1774462c4fad9984c97d3e66830e6f96, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Basically, for the pandas, you just point both hands
      at the same time.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0beef7a5b7c52154b8617cd163db6aa6, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Got it.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7fc74f299b0544242b9b631105640ca8, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "OK. Let\u2019s add that in."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e1b827819d07701419b7aad0146c11de, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I won\u2019t let you down."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6b699ff9625a8cc4fbda5255afd6fa98, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: ' I know.'
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 480aa042eff7a8a488f690c565e69277, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: How was that?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5e123f03112b34845876cb1f76de9783, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I won\u2019t lie, it\u2019s harder. There\u2019s a
      lot happening."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a00c5838684b4f84da47e376a8461f38, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "You\u2019ll get the hang of it."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b8353e498a7379c4a855be1e873e0295, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "And you\u2019ll be pleased to know that because of
      your unique situation, management have simplified your routine quite a bit,
      at least for now."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c55abbcbe81b68240a37f7bd1a34d290, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 8.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "There\u2019s basically only one more thing to add."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cf336992000267d4bbcbf2063d0ededb, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "That\u2019s a relief!"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5fdfff24f9714a24a9486e2aea3eacef, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "It\u2019s important though, so pay attention."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5614090f810e19f45b42a024ba9962e1, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Yes boss!
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dc14201f63c157f4ca90a1d696fc865c, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: So, for every concert, each idol chooses a signature
      pose.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 13820049e53b65e44999d95225009a01, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: This is a special pose, and the crowd love it when you
      get it right.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2d2a46f82a0a03b48b71b9821a6a4d7a, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: How does it work?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 80f7891ff58b69b4596d9201b4d983ad, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Just like everything else, you have to do your pose
      when the lightshow tells you to.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 63d20822b22a097469ba82c448e7847e, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "But first, you have to choose it of course. Let\u2019s
      do that now."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 06e01ece334589645b8e4fdf3eded74a, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Like, choose my pose right now?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 820f507ddce3f8a4b9098f11f4a5a57c, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: You have three options.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 461e7495862a27f47af05987a4251cc4, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Just decide which one you want and hold it for a few
      seconds.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: aa96dd6b8a559b64498b5a54266d67a9, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Then that will be set as your pose for the night!
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7e0972b506014bb479bf607ce4e0f8cf, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "\u2026Interesting choice."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: aa96dd6b8a559b64498b5a54266d67a9, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: What do you mean by that??
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7fb3c5e19c69d8f4dbba68cc53d382cb, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Nothing, nothing. You\u2019ll do great with that pose!
      Now let\u2019s practise it."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7718b71e100e7b6419a126deefd26657, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "This one\u2019s a bit different, right?"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f6f0c8268958c4844b98640e662e3d13, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Yeah, but they\u2019ll cue you for this too."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 42455d0dbc6ab284bb2a6c2d22c9cdf8, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: When you see the sign of your pose just do it! Hold
      it for maximum impact!
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 23a3e1107a28248478d12d40a998d07b, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 6.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Just do it where I see it?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c34bf22d16299ee4f8e5251e7e0432e0, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Yep! And remember to hold for as long as you\u2019re
      told, if you can, the crowd love that. Let\u2019s try it."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ee1500e687fab094c88ff202da2e40c4, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 7.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I think I\u2019m getting the hang of this. Are we done
      now?"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 98bd3d9406579024fab66300dd062968, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Almost. We can\u2019t forget the most important thing."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 770724aa9a51a7f4ba09640186130cd0, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "What\u2019s that?"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86f7f2059fa37194e988da819b600c33, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Well, question for you Shiki, Why are we here?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a607fef064122b548b03c36f22599a18, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: To give people something to do on this boring ship,
      and feed the otaku so that they have something to write about on their blogs
      and message boards?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f2351d40273a10241ad55a2c1094d4aa, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 8.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Hey, harsh! I\u2019ll admit it\u2019s pretty much the
      only game in town, but some of those blogs are actually really well written!
      I mean, the author of Goto\u2019s Garden is a poet."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c2913b56842db514483473e92a95248f, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 13.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Maki.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e2ab28e2837261a479a302f4be1fa6fe, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Anyway, you\u2019re half correct."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6ccb32a5ef362dd4d8310000fd8c875c, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Haven\u2019t you ever thought that there might be another
      purpose to all of this?"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b1ecf342dab7184f9eace48be5c1ed0, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Well\u2026 yeah. but you always clammed up when I tried
      to talk to you about it."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1671b66fa01f792449ce59631ff1af89, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I\u2019m sorry Shiki. You know the contracts I signed
      when I started training? They had a bit about not telling."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bd90a091ad7a32143bf9d701bf2f647e, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 7.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "It\u2019s OK\u2026 I kind of figured there was something."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8bd0ddf144e923a4faf64ad9fcd9f42c, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: I mean, everyone wonders why leadership encourages concert
      attendance so much.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f88708f55bad2794aa276606a2550218, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: People make jokes about it.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 34b6485a6522f044da30e6f23de89b96, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Yeah, like people drawing the pictures of the Admiral
      with pink cat ears and glowsticks, it\u2019s funny."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 33923ac18f485ad4c89b640ea66d5e01, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 6.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "And, well\u2026 no offence but I\u2019m training to
      be an engineer, and you\u2019re training to be an idol."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e240eb1848e942b439b89fa56770e838, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 8.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Why does your programme have like, three times the resources
      thrown at it than mine?
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 733b15b71ea3e094185ac4cf2136c3c5, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 6.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Well I always told you that what I do is important!
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2be0d9363aeb27647a1874fd7f1f3572, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Of course music is important, Maki!
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e7286089e26b234f878775830cfb596, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "You know I\u2019ve always supported you."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eed666c702f5d9d488445cd67c38e65e, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "But you asked me if I ever wondered if there was something
      more behind this, I\u2019m saying I did."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b46c15439ca5d2d4da811e37116f54f0, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Right. So.The big secret, or part of it.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dc70229ba592ab44db5515e992a05436, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I\u2019m listening."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4b455184d69ab4a4eb785c0b62aae003, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "So, you really can\u2019t tell anyone this. They\u2019re
      sorting a contract out for you right now. And I don\u2019t know everything\u2014"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e229ee7d68ce9704eabf487f3b9e3da1, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 9
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Sure, of course.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 60e9bac478bf92742b6545ac5406fe72, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "And I don\u2019t really understand how it works, but\u2014"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bea424e100f219b48a06c516b71b38db, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Maki, you\u2019re the one who keeps saying we don\u2019t
      have all day, what is it?"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1ef9fe9610697a3469060ab18cceaae4, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Maki, you\u2019re the one who keeps saying we don\u2019t
      have all day, what is it?"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1ef9fe9610697a3469060ab18cceaae4, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: The concerts help power the ship.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cc89fb687baa7f447b181220a2fc7836, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: ...
    snippetVA: {fileID: 0}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Our idol concerts. They power the ship.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d98f44efe018a5b4882f2c65e6fa3d9a, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "\u2026What?!"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3f1798592e2a272409f0fabae96c4af3, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I said I don\u2019t know how it works! They don\u2019t
      really tell us much more than that, and unlike you, I\u2019m not an engineer."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 672d538c7ee23434bb7eeac102595f58, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 7.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "It\u2019s something to do with the energy in the crowd.
      The more they get excited, the more charge for the ship\u2019s power."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 672d538c7ee23434bb7eeac102595f58, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 8.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "\u2026I don\u2019t know what to say. I knew something
      was going on, but I would have never guessed\u2014"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d31fdfa2467b54547b92bcd7644ec1ec, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 8.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "They keep it really secret. The only reason they\u2019re
      letting you perform without an iron clad contract is because you\u2019re my
      sister, they trust us, and there just isn\u2019t any time. You will be briefed
      after the gig, though."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f315426eb6cbb3c44865f2d96d83327d, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 16.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Sis, this is a lot to process.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4206f693a8e076d4e9fef047844afdf6, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Unfortunately you don\u2019t have time to process it
      now. I\u2019ll just tell you what you need to know for this performance."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f9b0fa07c21d6e0429db367f9ac78988, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 7.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "\u2026OK?"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b2a619f64c808234e8956d24ea795951, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "It\u2019s simple really. On the right of your screen
      you will see your score."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 004e999921b59924491953803730b02c, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "That\u2019s a system management has invented to show
      you how you\u2019re doing. How much power you are generating for the ship,
      I mean."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 243dcdb571e91c542b2178572ba15448, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 7.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: As I said earlier, the idol poses count for more.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 074484b51c89c52498b1215b1136368c, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "So I\u2019m not just risking public humiliation by
      performing untrained, this is actually like, a really important job. For the
      whole ship."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1f4ec1384e3704f44a18f4ef9ea13e3c, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 14.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: 'Pretty much yeah! '
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: af9b046ba581a5546a0b8c3d7b90fc16, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "But I know you can do it, Shiki. You\u2019ll smash
      it up there."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f20c94338d28d764c94e3393f7f0c9f9, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I guess I\u2019ll have to."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 05bba332cfeefba42a7747cd0c41ae05, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Oh there\u2019s one more thing that will help you out!
      The girls and I call it \u201CHyper Mode.\u201D"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: da8c28ccbe0f0ad4c9bb1eb7d18b45de, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 6.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "OK, what\u2019s that?"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0f772d23c766926459c0d9cf27affff9, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 3.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "It\u2019s one of the best parts! Basically, when you\u2019re
      doing really well, the crowd starts to go wild."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: beec9570333a7e94696443c177f91e45, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 8.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Everything counts for more. Your score goes up more
      quickly and you\u2019ll be generating more power for the ship!"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d759dfa11af067041adbc31d9f02727e, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 8.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "That sounds great! How can I tell when I\u2019m in
      Hyper Mode? "
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c42b63283ade50346841d0e30bfeae60, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 6.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "You can\u2019t miss it! First off, you will hear the
      crowd cheering more for you."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b5b802a699c1ac240a5e81b8562f3834, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Second, bracelets will appear on your wrist and stars
      will start to come out from them! There\u2019ll be stars coming from the floor
      too!"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d2a9970aab13b794abd31582937b0be2, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 9.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: That does sound pretty hyper!
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 194d9a58c6f05664c967e6c2096c1ded, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "It\u2019s great! The only thing is if you stop doing
      as good, you\u2019ll leave Hyper Mode and the crowd will go back to normal."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c268c5e3df2679e41b9156676c798aeb, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 9.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Oh\u2026 Can I hype them back up again? "
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 525b5aeeb1e91004d8812283c27898a5, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Of course! You will go back into Hyper Mode if you start
      doing really well again.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c9a32f1741eb21749b6f35965e28ed6b, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 7.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: '*Knocking*'
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 580c6e42c40d3214fa268b0830eca91a, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2
    characterName: 
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Oh that\u2019s the doctor. She\u2019s right, though.
      I need to get off this call and rest now, otherwise I won\u2019t have the energy
      to watch you this evening, even through the headset."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 48be3183f51537946b877d637acb68ec, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 11.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "So we\u2019re almost out of time. Listen Shiki, you
      can\u2019t repeat what I just told you about the performances and the ship\u2019s
      power, OK?"
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ef7ba85842e9a6d4ea735cf841bd6330, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 9.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: 'Of course, but listen, we do need to talk more later. '
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 10dbadeba52052b46b752b3c342fd77e, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Once this concert is out of the way. I have so many
      questions.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b0d5d4d430011f14596545fdc3aeea24, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 4.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Of course! But for now just focus on tonight. I think
      I\u2019ve covered everything. I know you will be great."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0a1a256b143ea2d429b7cb27565de045, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 9.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "Thanks. I\u2019ll try my best."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a4a29b7cf3989e84085cdd7dfa751b81, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: And enjoy yourself up there! Concerts can be scary,
      but they are a lot of fun, I promise.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: be9b89980209f164f9454b4ffbb6d6b2, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 8.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: I love you Maki.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 24c764e251faf39419d5760ceccd7d46, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.5
    characterName: Shiki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: "I love you too, sis. I\u2019ll be right there supporting
      you. Well, I\u2019ll be here, watching you on a headset. But I\u2019ll be watching.
      Bye, Shiki."
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1961f74e6628f0144a4fd2a780025b0e, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 11.5
    characterName: Maki
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Bye, sis.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 056ed5fbba5e6d34a9f64c54fd163a4e, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 1.8
    characterName: Shiki
  currentSnippetIndex: 0
  isTesting: 0
